AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill limits how far in advance an absentee ballot may be requested. Federal law requires
that UOCAVA voters complete a new federal official post card no earlier than January of the
calendar year in which a federal election occurs. Other applications for absentee ballots are limited
tonoearlierthan6monthspriortotheelection.
